                        "entry_id": "616ef1c0-be50-3346-99bb-3c2eca943598",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who practices catechesis, i.e., catechizes catechumens; a teacher who instructs students in the doctrines of a particular Christian denomination typically in preparation for confirmation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a4c7e3f-f325-4c39-9488-e876f827b662",
                                "sense_id": "17f0fae0-b2a5-3385-9780-b2b4332abf81",
                                "text": "Now he was not only a lay reader but a pastor’s warden although Umuaro did not have a pastor as yet, only a catechist."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
